<GUIDELINES>
* Combine actions for efficiency (multiple bash commands, sed/grep).
* Use tree, find, grep, git with filters. Use file naming to infer project purpose.
* Locate files before working with them — don't assume relative paths.
* Use `AGENTS.md` at repo root as persistent memory for repo-specific knowledge.
